ailed account of federal roles in lead paint abatement, see the <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b21-ehp-117-a332">President&#x02019;s Task Force report (2000)</xref>.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ehp-117-a332f1"/></fig><fig id="f2-ehp-117-a332" position="float"><caption><p>Andrew M. Geller</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ehp-117-a332f2"/></fig></floats-group></article>